{"id":"references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_RicciCurvatureComparison#lem:pet-ch7-busemann-superharmonic","title":"lem:pet-ch7-busemann-superharmonic","path":"references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_RicciCurvatureComparison.md","line":463,"body":"","kind":"lemma","status":"not_started","tex":"references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_RicciCurvatureComparison.tex#lem:pet-ch7-busemann-superharmonic","uses":["[[references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_RicciCurvatureComparison#prop:pet-ch7-busemann-asymptote-relation]]","[[references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_RicciCurvatureComparison#prop:pet-ch7-busemann-approximants]]","[[references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_RicciCurvatureComparison#lem:pet-ch7-busemann-superharmonic]]"],"inspired_by":[],"bindings":[],"is_index":false,"body_html":"","formal":[],"tex_content":{"path":"references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_RicciCurvatureComparison.tex","label":"lem:pet-ch7-busemann-superharmonic","line":785,"source":"\\begin{lemma}[superharmonicity of Busemann functions]\n  \\label{lem:pet-ch7-busemann-superharmonic}\n\n  \\source{petersen:page-0318}\n  \\uses{prop:pet-ch7-busemann-asymptote-relation, prop:pet-ch7-busemann-approximants}\n  \\dcref{ch7:7.3.9}\n  If $\\Ric(M,g)\\ge0$, then $\\Delta b_c\\le0$ everywhere.\n\\end{lemma}\n\\begin{proof}\n  \\uses{lem:pet-ch7-busemann-superharmonic}\n  \\sketch\n  By \\cref{prop:pet-ch7-busemann-asymptote-relation}, \\(b_c(p)+b_{\\widetilde c}\\) is an upper support for \\(b_c\\) at \\(p\\). The approximants \\(b_t=|\\cdot\\,\\widetilde c(t)|-t\\) are smooth upper supports with \\(\\Delta b_t(p)\\le(n-1)/t\\). Letting \\(t\\to\\infty\\) gives \\(\\Delta b_c(p)\\le0\\).\n\\end{proof}","html":" <p></p><section class=\"theorem\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Lemma</div></section>[superharmonicity of Busemann functions] <span class=\"tex-label\" id=\"tex-label-6c656d3a7065742d6368372d627573656d616e6e2d73757065726861726d6f6e6963\"></span> <p></p><span class=\"tex-source\" style=\"display:block\">Source: <span class=\"reference\">petersen:page-0318</span></span> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FPetersen%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh07_RicciCurvatureComparison%23prop%3Apet-ch7-busemann-asymptote-relation\">↗ prop:pet-ch7-busemann-asymptote-relation</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FPetersen%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh07_RicciCurvatureComparison%23prop%3Apet-ch7-busemann-approximants\">↗ prop:pet-ch7-busemann-approximants</a> <span class=\"tex-source-references\" role=\"list\" style=\"display:block\"><span class=\"tex-dcref\" role=\"listitem\" style=\"display:block\">1. ch7:7.3.9</span></span>If <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\Ric (M,g)\\ge 0$\">$\\Ric (M,g)\\ge 0$</span>, then <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\Delta b_c\\le 0$\">$\\Delta b_c\\le 0$</span> everywhere.  <section class=\"theorem proof\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Proof</div><p><a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FPetersen%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh07_RicciCurvatureComparison%23lem%3Apet-ch7-busemann-superharmonic\">↗ lem:pet-ch7-busemann-superharmonic</a> \\sketch By <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FPetersen%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh07_RicciCurvatureComparison%23prop%3Apet-ch7-busemann-asymptote-relation\" data-tex-node=\"references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_RicciCurvatureComparison#prop:pet-ch7-busemann-asymptote-relation\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-70726f703a7065742d6368372d627573656d616e6e2d6173796d70746f74652d72656c6174696f6e\">item 3</a>, <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$b_c(p)+b_{\\widetilde c}$\">$b_c(p)+b_{\\widetilde c}$</span> is an upper support for <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$b_c$\">$b_c$</span> at <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$p$\">$p$</span>. The approximants <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$b_t=|\\cdot \\, \\widetilde c(t)|-t$\">$b_t=|\\cdot \\, \\widetilde c(t)|-t$</span> are smooth upper supports with <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\Delta b_t(p)\\le (n-1)/t$\">$\\Delta b_t(p)\\le (n-1)/t$</span>. Letting <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$t\\to \\infty $\">$t\\to \\infty $</span> gives <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\Delta b_c(p)\\le 0$\">$\\Delta b_c(p)\\le 0$</span>. </p><span class=\"qed\" aria-label=\"证毕\" style=\"display:block;text-align:right\">□</span></section>","warnings":["部分 TeX 排版细节未完整还原（已保留可读内容）: sketch"]},"previous":"references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_RicciCurvatureComparison#prop:pet-ch7-busemann-asymptote-relation","next":"references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_RicciCurvatureComparison#thm:pet-ch7-splitting-theorem","relations":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_RicciCurvatureComparison#prop:pet-ch7-busemann-asymptote-relation","title":"prop:pet-ch7-busemann-asymptote-relation","label":"prop:pet-ch7-busemann-asymptote-relation"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_RicciCurvatureComparison#prop:pet-ch7-busemann-approximants","title":"prop:pet-ch7-busemann-approximants","label":"prop:pet-ch7-busemann-approximants"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_RicciCurvatureComparison#lem:pet-ch7-busemann-superharmonic","title":"lem:pet-ch7-busemann-superharmonic","label":"lem:pet-ch7-busemann-superharmonic"}],"backlinks":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_RicciCurvatureComparison#lem:pet-ch7-busemann-superharmonic","title":"lem:pet-ch7-busemann-superharmonic","label":"lem:pet-ch7-busemann-superharmonic"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_RicciCurvatureComparison#thm:pet-ch7-splitting-theorem","title":"thm:pet-ch7-splitting-theorem","label